#  EventHub Development Log: Dynamic Staff Designation & Permission-Driven Layout

> **Date:** October 16, 2026  
> **Module:** Event Team Delegation & Operational Staff Workspace  
> **Status:**  Completed & Verified  
> **Specification Reference:** Sections § 5.2, § 5.3, § 5.4 & § 7.6 (Product & System Overview)

---

## 📌 Executive Summary

We have engineered the complete end-to-end operational delegation workflow connecting **Event Owners / Management** with the **On-Ground Event Staff**. 

Instead of a generic staff role with static tabs, the system now enforces **role-based and designation-specific permissions**. When an Event Owner or Operations Lead invites a staff member to an event, they select a specific **functional designation** (e.g., *Gate Scanner*, *Security & Incident Officer*, *Guest Relations*, or *Custom Specialist*). Upon login, the **Staff Mobile Workspace dynamically adapts its layout, operational tabs, and action tools** strictly according to the permissions granted.

---

